                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                        Atendimento humano e rápido.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="relative w-full h-100 lg:h-137.5 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl group">
                <img 
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?q=80&w=1920&auto=format&fit=crop" 
                    alt="Sala de estar moderna decorada com móveis da Samavi" 
